# Triangle bass line with octave arpeggio jumps on some notes, then the 50 % pulse bass.
tempo 120
steps 32
tail 1.0
track bass
preset 128 0 0 60 160 20 0 0 128 0 128 210 0 0 0 0 0 0
note 0 A1 2 127
note 2 A1 1 90
note 4 C2 2 127
param p2 56 6
note 6 E2 2 127
param p2 0 8
note 8 G1 2 127
note 10 A1 3 127
param p1 64 16
note 16 A1 2 127
note 18 A2 1 100
note 20 C2 2 127
note 22 E1 2 127
note 24 G1 2 127
param p2 120 26
note 26 A1 4 127
expect sound 0 30
expect idle 40
expect peak_below -6
